%% TECH-015 Test suite at its time budget
%% How a merged test goes: one page load and one seed, then every check on the page, the window resized between widths.
flowchart TD
    A[Test starts] --> B[Seed the test data once]
    B --> C[goto opens the page, about 300 ms until React shows it]
    C --> D[Checks at the first width]
    D --> E{More widths or journeys on this page?}
    E -- yes --> F[Resize the window, or go on from where the last check left the page]
    F --> D
    E -- no --> G{More pages?}
    G -- yes --> C
    G -- no --> H[Test ends, the test cleans up its data]
